# The search stage's full grid of scored cells: tens of MB per run and regenerated by re-running the fit. The fit's
# conclusions (fit_results.csv, clean.csv, report.md, config_log.txt) are small and stay tracked.
results/fits/**/profile.csv

# Figures drawn from new runs; those from the paper's fits (figures/paper) stay tracked
figures/runs/
figures/smoke/

# The pointer to the newest rate-utility sweep, rewritten by every run
results/rate_utility/latest_rateutil.txt
